control: Once backfill's second pass has ended, each tick decides and scans what waits, a bounded number from where the last stopped
removes: the gate-and-scan loop stopped by a throttle in a tick goes on deciding the rest of its read without the hits of the bodies it did not scan
packages: ./worker/internal/deltasync/tick
tests: TestAThrottledBodyStopsTheAccountsScanning
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes
